CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:EXPECTED per demands: application/{services\,ports\,useCases}\,
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:infrastructure/{one folder per port + Env adapter}\, domain/{models\,valueObjects}\,
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:control/{dependencyInjection\,entryPoint}\, camelCase folders (Scala)\, no files in any layer root.
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:ACTUAL:
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:1. application/{ports\,services\,use_cases} — snake_case\, expected camelCase useCases.
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:2. infrastructure/{database\,environment\,filesystem\,parsers} — 4 folders for 3 ports
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:(DTRLoad\, CUWrite\, ContentRead); filesystem implements all three ports\, database has
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:no port\, parsers are helpers. Expected one folder per port.
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:3. domain/{models} only — ValueObject.scala sits inside models/; expected models + valueObjects.
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:4. control/{cli\,dependency_injection\,entry_point} — extra cli/ folder (CliParser.scala);
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:expected dependencyInjection + entryPoint only\, camelCase.
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:5. infrastructure/environment/Environment.scala is a singleton reading sys.env plus an
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:in-memory overrides map\, but loads no .env/config file — despite its docstring claiming
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-4-layer-layout-demands-violated.md=HEADING:"loaded .env values". Expected Env adapter loading config and env variables.
