CODEX.README.md=HEADING:Getting Started
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:Prerequisites
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:Quick Start: Greenfield Project
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:1. Generate a baseline DTR for a new app
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:2. Draft CU content (cus.json) — work with an Advisor to decompose
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:the design into Computational Units
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:3. Compile CUs into ITR frames
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:4. Implement CUs (Coder session)
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:The Coder reads the compiled frames from itr-buffer/my-app.itr/
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:and implements them in dependency order
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:5. After implementation\, re-scan to produce next-iteration DTR
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:Quick Start: Existing Codebase
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:1. Extract baseline DTR from existing code
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:2. Continue with the same workflow as greenfield
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:(draft CU content → compile → implement → iterate)
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:Agent Sessions (with OpenCode)
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:Start an Advisor session for design work
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:Start a Coder session for implementation
CODEX.README.md=HEADING:License
REL.README.md.HEADING->them=IMPLEMENTS:implements them
